/* Headlines drawn under each framed screenshot.

   frameit matches a key as a case-insensitive substring of the screenshot's
   full path, so these keys keep the numeric prefix the capture writes. A bare
   "home" would also match every file under /home/... on a Linux runner.

   These are store copy, not UI strings — write the benefit, not the feature.
   The app-store-optimization skill covers what belongs here. */

{{#tabs}}
"{{screenshotKey}}" = "{{label}}";
{{/tabs}}
